te, mientras son atacados por cazarrecompensas.","c":["Sci-Fi Horror","Series","Science fiction"],"i":"https://images.pluto.tv/series/66a269ea8dfe2a00133cff60/tile_1769470201557.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=900&q=75&w=900","ep":"S02E02"},{"s":1795884241,"e":1795887301,"t":"Z Nation","st":"Carretera Zombi","d":"Finalmente hallan a Murphy. En una misión para evacuar sobrevivientes a un lugar seguro. los blásters atacan.","c":["Sci-Fi Horror","Series","Science fiction"],"i":"https://images.pluto.tv/series/66a269ea8dfe2a00133cff60/tile_1769470201557.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=900&q=75&w=900","ep":"S02E03"},{"s":1795887301,"e":1795890361,"t":"Z Nation","st":"Lote 47","d":"El grupo se abre camino hasta el invernadero donde el Lote 47 está siendo cultivado por Odegard.","c":["Sci-Fi Horror","Series","Science fiction"],"i":"https://images.pluto.tv/series/66a269ea8dfe2a00133cff60/tile_1769470201557.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=900&q=75&w=900","ep":"S02E04"},{"s":1795890361,"e":1795893361,"t":"Z Nation","st":"¡Zombebé!","d":"El pasado de Murphy vuelve a perseguirlo cuando Serena lo rastrea. El equipo se topa con una granja escondida.","c":["Sci-Fi Horror","Series","Science fiction"],"i":"https://images.pluto.tv/series/66a269ea8dfe2a00133cff60/tile_1769470201557.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=900&q=75&w=900","ep":"S02E05"},{"s":1795893361,"e":1795896421,"t":"Z Nation","st":"Bebé zombi de papi","d":"Murphy se separa del grupo temiendo que se lleven a la bebé y la maten.","c":["Sci-Fi Horror","Series","Science fiction"],"i":"https://images.pluto.tv/series/66a269ea8dfe2a00133cff60/tile_1769470201557.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=900&q=75&w=900","ep":"S02E06"},{"s":1795896421,"e":1795899481,"t":"Z Nation","st":"Por el Mississippi","d":"Mientras cruzaba el río Mississippi, el grupo se involucra en un accidente y 10K se separa.","c":["Sci-Fi Horror","Series","Science fiction"],"i":"https://images.pluto.tv/series/66a269ea8dfe2a00133cff60/tile_1769470201557.jpg?fill=blur